sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Vaggelis admin
  participant B as Browser
  participant PX as proxy.ts<br/>Next 16 Node runtime
  participant SA as Server Component<br/>/admin/*
  participant AUTH as Supabase Auth<br/>ES256 JWT
  participant DB as Postgres<br/>profiles

  U->>B: Visit /admin/songs
  B->>PX: GET /admin/songs with cookies
  PX->>PX: createServerClient<br/>await cookies<br/>publishable key
  PX->>AUTH: getClaims<br/>local WebCrypto verify<br/>rotates refresh token
  AUTH-->>PX: claims or null
  alt claims == null
    PX-->>B: 307 redirect to /admin/login<br/>next param origin-allowlisted
  else claims present
    PX->>B: set refreshed Set-Cookie<br/>SameSite=Strict on /admin/*
    PX->>SA: continue request
    SA->>SA: createServerClient<br/>await cookies
    SA->>AUTH: getClaims<br/>authoritative local verify
    AUTH-->>SA: claims
    SA->>DB: SELECT role FROM public.profiles<br/>WHERE id = auth.uid()
    DB-->>SA: role = admin
    alt role in admin or editor
      SA-->>B: render page<br/>Server Component
    else
      SA-->>B: forbidden Next 16 authInterrupt 403
    end
  end

  Note over SA,AUTH: Never use getSession for authorization —<br/>cookies are unverified and forgeable
  Note over PX,AUTH: getClaims runs locally without network round trip<br/>on asymmetric JWT signing keys ES256
